vmocs-slurm-plugin (0.1.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Preserve submitting-user ownership for checkpoints saved by root cleanup.
  * Complete saves after clean TPM-backed shutdown and tolerate teardown races.
  * Scope QEMU -no-shutdown to supervised sessions and surface startup logs.
  * Honor VMOCS_CONFIG for manual commands on compute nodes.

